# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vite client-side bundle
# Replace with your key in .env.local (never commit .env.local to version control)
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# ==============================================================================
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Open: https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a personal Google account (no billing card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate/reveal the Demo Key and copy it.
# 5. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key as VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
# Note: Maps Demo Keys have a daily reset quota and are NOT for production use.
#
# ==============================================================================
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# ==============================================================================
# Enable the following APIs in your Google Cloud Console:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Routes API
# - Geocoding API
# - Elevation API
# - Weather API
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer and API scope:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
